},{"surface":"நலனே","parts":[{"text":"நலன்","lemma":"நலன்","gloss":"beauty"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphatic particle"}],"gloss":"beauty indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஏனல்","parts":[{"text":"ஏனல்","lemma":"ஏனல்","gloss":"millet field"}],"gloss":"millet field"},{"surface":"காவலர்","parts":[{"text":"காவல்","lemma":"காவல்","gloss":"guarding"},{"text":"அர்","lemma":"அர்","gloss":"plural suffix"}],"gloss":"guards"},{"surface":"கவணொலி","parts":[{"text":"கவண்","lemma":"கவண்","gloss":"sling"},{"text":"ஒலி","lemma":"ஒலி","gloss":"sound"}],"gloss":"sound of the sling"},{"surface":"வெரீஇக்","parts":[{"text":"வெரீஇக்","lemma":"வெரீஇக்","gloss":"having feared"}],"gloss":"having feared","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கான","parts":[{"text":"கான்","lemma":"கான்","gloss":"forest"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"adjectival suffix"}],"gloss":"forest"},{"surface":"யானை","parts":[{"text":"யானை","lemma":"யானை","gloss":"elephant"}],"gloss":"elephant"},{"surface":"கைவிடு","parts":[{"text":"கை","lemma":"கை","gloss":"trunk"},{"text":"விடு","lemma":"விடு","gloss":"to let go"}],"gloss":"letting go from its trunk"},{"surface":"பசுங்கழை","parts":[{"text":"பசுமை","lemma":"பசுமை","gloss":"green"},{"text":"கழை","lemma":"கழை","gloss":"bamboo"}],"gloss":"green bamboo"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மீன்","parts":[{"text":"மீன்","lemma":"மீன்","gloss":"fish"}],"gloss":"fish"},{"surface":"எறி","parts":[{"text":"எறி","lemma":"எறி","gloss":"to cast"}],"gloss":"casting"},{"surface":"தூண்டிலின்","parts":[{"text":"தூண்டில்","lemma":"தூண்டில்","gloss":"fishing rod"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like a fishing rod"},{"surface":"நிவக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"நிவ","lemma":"நிவ","gloss":"to rise high"},{"text":"க்","lemma":"க்","gloss":"future tense marker"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"adjectival participle suffix"}],"gloss":"that rises high"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கானக","parts":[{"text":"கானக","lemma":"கானக","gloss":"forest"}],"gloss":"forest","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நாடனொடு","parts":[{"text":"நாடன்","lemma":"நாடன்","gloss":"lord of the land"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with the lord of the land"},{"surface":"ஆண்டு","parts":[{"text":"ஆண்டு","lemma":"ஆண்டு","gloss":"there"}],"gloss":"there"},{"surface":"ஒழிந்தன்றே","parts":[{"text":"ஒழி","lemma":"ஒழி","gloss":"to stay behind"},{"text":"ந்த்","lemma":"ந்த்","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"அன்று","lemma":"அன்று","gloss":"empty morph"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphatic particle"}],"gloss":"remained indeed"}]}],"literal":"I indeed here am indeed, my beauty / millet field guards' sling sound having feared / forest elephant let-go green bamboo / fish-casting fishing-rod-like rises-high / forest land lord-with there remained indeed","translation":"I am here, but my beauty has stayed behind there, with the lord of the forest land where the green bamboo, released by a forest elephant startled by the sound of the millet-guards' slings, springs back high like a fishing rod cast for fish.","modern":"நான் மட்டும்தான் இங்கே இருக்கிறேன். ஆனால், தினைப்புனக் காவலர்களின் கவண் ஒலியைக் கேட்டு அஞ்சிய காட்டு யானை தன் கையிலிருந்து விட்டுவிட்ட பசிய மூங்கில், மீன் பிடிக்கும் தூண்டில் போல மேலே நிமிர்ந்து உயரும் காட்டை உடைய நாட்டின் தலைவனுடன், என் அழகு அங்கேயே தங்கிவிட்டது.","explanation":"The heroine speaks to her confidante after returning home from a secret meeting with her lover. She laments that while her physical self is back at home, her beauty and heart have remained behind in his mountainous country. The poem employs a vivid mountain image (Kuriñci tiṇai) of a forest elephant that bends a green bamboo to feed, but suddenly lets it go in fear when it hears the sound of the millet-guards' slings. The bamboo then springs back high, resembling a fishing rod cast into the air. This image serves as an implicit metaphor (uḷḷuṟai) for the lover who held her close and then suddenly had to let her go, leaving her thoughts and beauty springing back to his land.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}